1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,240
Woman: Are you all set for the company award ceremony tomorrow

2
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,210
I hear it's going to be spectacular.

3
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:11,300
Man: Not yet. Everything looks good in the auditorium

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,020
but I still need to pick up some food and drinks.

5
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:18,170
Woman: I can help you with that. I was just on my way to the supermarket.

6
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,140
Man: That would be great.

7
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,250
Woman: Just give me a list and I'll head out.
